<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Osaka Guide: 10 places – Dotonbori, castle, Shinsekai &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Dotonbori</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come at dusk and take small portions at several stalls instead of one big meal. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>135.50157,34.66903,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. Kuromon Market</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Come before 10 a.m. and bring cash for small tasting portions. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>135.50698,34.66533,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Osaka Castle</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come in the morning when it is still cool and empty, and plan time for the park. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>135.5254,34.68718,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Shinsekai &amp; Tsutenkaku Tower</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Eat kushikatsu and follow the “no double dipping” rule. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>135.50619,34.65209,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Umeda Sky Building &amp; Floating Garden</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come shortly before sunset and stay until the lights come on. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>135.49053,34.70529,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Shinsaibashi &amp; Amerikamura</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come in the afternoon and combine the stroll with Dotonbori in the evening. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>135.50036,34.67452,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Hōzenji Yokochō – the lane behind Dotonbori</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come after dinner and enjoy the calm after the bustle. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>135.50332,34.66797,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Nakazakichō – retro cafés in old houses</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come in the afternoon and check the opening times of the small shops. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>135.50564,34.70721,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Namba Yasaka Shrine – the lion’s head</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Go early in the morning or late in the afternoon when it is quiet. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>135.49673,34.66148,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Nara – temples &amp; tame deer</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Go early before the groups arrive and keep food out of your bag. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/osaka/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>135.83996,34.68404,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
